    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group are delighted to present this four-bedroom detached dormer home, ideally positioned in the picturesque countryside of Drumcliffe, Co. Sligo. Set against a spectacular backdrop of the surrounding Dartry Mountains and rolling countryside, this attractive home enjoys a wonderfully peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of Sligo Town and a host of everyday amenities. The property offers versatile accommodation throughout, comprising four bedrooms and two bathrooms. The interiors are welcoming, with a  fitted kitchen with wood flooring, a separate sitting room featuring wood flooring and a fireplace, along with an additional dining/living room offering a versatile space for both everyday living and entertaining. Large windows throughout the property allow for excellent natural light while also taking full advantage of the beautiful surrounding scenery. Externally, this home is particularly impressive. The property is surrounded by beautifully maintained mature gardens, featuring expansive lawns, established hedging, colourful planting and a paved patio area ideal for outdoor seating and entertaining. A generous driveway provides ample off-street parking, while the mature grounds offer wonderful privacy and space. The property also benefits from a generous detached garage, complete with electricity and plumbing, providing excellent additional storage and practical space. The truly striking Benbulben mountain and countryside views provide a spectacular backdrop to the property and are a standout feature of this charming home. Despite its tranquil countryside setting, the property enjoys an extremely convenient location within walking distance of Rathcormac Village, where amenities include a local shop, pub, gyms, church and primary school, along with access to both local and national bus routes. Sligo Town Centre is approximately a 10-minute drive away, offering an extensive range of shops, schools, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities and services, while Grange Village is also approximately 10 minutes by car. Offering generous accommodation, mature gardens, ample parking, a substantial detached garage and breathtaking surroundings, this delightful Drumcliffe property presents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a family home in one of North Sligo's most scenic and convenient locations. To arrange a viewing, contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall(3.67m x 3.75m)\r\nWood flooring. Understairs storage. Arch to main hallway.\r\n\r\nSitting Room (4.68m x 3.34m)\r\nWood flooring. Long bay window. Solid fuel stove.\r\n\r\nDining Room (4.22m x 3.34m)\r\nWood flooring. Feature open fireplace. Dual aspect windows.\r\n\r\nKitchen (4.16m x 3.29m)\r\nWood flooring. Integrated oven, hob & extractor fan. Ample kitchen presses/ units.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (1.69m x 2.50m)\r\nAmple presses/ storage. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (2.77m x 3.64m)\r\nWood flooring. Generous single room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.60m x 4.56m)\r\nDouble room. Wood flooring. Built in wardrobe and vanity unit. Large bay window to front of property. \r\n\r\nBathroom (2.54m x 1.67m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Bath. \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nLanding (1.80m x 3.72m)\r\nCarpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.39m x 4.44m)\r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring. Built in wardrobe & shelving.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 (1.69m x 2.16m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Electric shower.\r\n\r\nOffice/ Storage (3.68m x 1.55m)\r\nCarpet flooring. Storage space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (5.04m x 2.75m)\r\nDouble room. Wood flooring. Built in wardrobe & shelving.\r\n\r\nGarage (4.33m x 7.49m)\r\nConcrete flooring. Electrical connection. Plumbed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating. \r\nPVC Double glazed windows to the front of the property & kitchen, and external doors.\r\nAmple storage spaces. \r\nGenerous garage with electrical connection & plumbed.\r\nAmple off street parking. \r\nBreathtaking views of Benbulben & the Dartry Mountain range. \r\nWithin walking distance of Rathcormac Village, offering a local shop, pub, gyms, church and primary school.\r\nConvenient access to both local and national bus routes.\r\nApproximately 10 minutes’ drive from Sligo Town Centre, with an extensive range of shops, schools, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities and services.\r\nApproximately 10 minutes’ drive from Grange Village."
      },
